    "text": "By K8 Newsdesk ,\n5 hours ago POCAHONTAS, Ark. (KAIT) - A Pancake and Waffle House in Pocahontas caught fire Wednesday evening. Police Chief David Edington said the building on Highway 62 erupted into flames about 5:30 p.m. He said the building was closed at the time and no one was hurt. The fire was extinguished about... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
